The deepest quoted paragraph takes a lazy line across missed prefixes

```
> > - > +
> > - > +
>  s
.
<blockquote>
  <blockquote>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <blockquote><p>+</p></blockquote>
      </li>
      <li>
        <blockquote><p>+
s</p></blockquote>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </blockquote>
</blockquote>
```

```
> > a
> b
.
<blockquote>
  <blockquote><p>a
b</p></blockquote>
</blockquote>
```

```
> > * > +
> > * > +
>  tail
.
<blockquote>
  <blockquote>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <blockquote><p>+</p></blockquote>
      </li>
      <li>
        <blockquote><p>+
tail</p></blockquote>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </blockquote>
</blockquote>
```
